    },
    {
      "@type": "PropertyValue",
      "name": "expected_prediction",
      "value": "For fully-connected networks, N_c(w) will show a non-monotonic trend with a bifurcation point at w_c (e.g., N_c(w) ≤ w_c for w < w_c, then increasing or dropping sharply). For convolutional/spectral networks, N_c(w) will remain flat or decrease across w, indicating a fat solution space without bifurcation. The surprise score will decrease from 1.0 to <0.3 upon verification."
